{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">李泳豪日前在社交平台的限時動態中分享了一段短片，預告將與父親李家鼎（鼎爺）首次以「父子檔」姿態攜手拍廣告。從片段中可見，身穿橙色T恤的鼎爺與李泳豪一同現身拳館，兩人精神奕奕地向鏡頭打招呼，不過對於今次拍攝的具體內容，鼎爺則刻意賣了個關子，暫時未有向外透露。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9606ad66-58a7-47c4-9ca9-3e00e6a92870.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026OG0QBT3ca91788512387.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9606ad66-58a7-47c4-9ca9-3e00e6a92870.jpeg.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"aec6c8f5-90f0-4976-b170-f0518588b866.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026mxoB5Kz83i1788512387.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"aec6c8f5-90f0-4976-b170-f0518588b866.jpeg.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鼎爺去年曾因患上胃炎兼貧血而一度暴瘦20磅，再加上今年3月前妻施明離世，令他傷心欲絕，當時出席喪禮時更面容憔悴且需人攙扶，令外界相當擔憂其健康狀況。不過，鼎爺在6月接受TVB娛樂新聞台訪問時透露，經過一段時間的休養後，心情已漸趨平復，身體狀況亦愈來愈好。如今看到他精神抖擻地投入工作、狀態大勇，讓不少網民都感到十分放心。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-05T12:19:53.958520+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":289,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}